      "featured_image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0631/0251/7500/files/4_3_Pantalica.jpg?v=1754389520",
      "description_html": "<p class=\"generic-text  padding-line-element\">The Pantalica rug by Elisa Ossino embellishes the outdoor space with an artistic touch. Drawing inspiration from ancient Mediterranean cultures and landscapes, the Pantalica collection is named after the famous UNESCO World Heritage Site in southeastern Sicily.</p>\n<p class=\"generic-text  padding-line-element\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>Specially crafted for exterior use, this rug channels timeless aesthetics into a design that harmonizes seamlessly with the entire Molteni&amp;C Outdoor Collection.</span><br></p>\n<section id=\"block-1\" class=\"content-block\">\n<div class=\"wrapper-content  dimension-medium\">\n<div class=\"block-text-img block-text-img_small block-text-img_text-right  row\">\n<div class=\"block-text-img-text  col-4  is-768\">\n<p class=\"generic-text\">Unevenly cut strips of weather-resistant polypropylene are loosely woven, allowing air and light to pass through while creating uneven edging that lends a compelling finish to the rug. The Pantalica rug complements the Pantalica daybed, Pantalica coffee table, Pantalica stools, and all other designs from the Molteni&amp;C Outdoor Collection for a harmonious composition.<br></p>\n<p class=\"generic-text\">Contact us for custom sizes. </p>\n<p class=\"block-text-label\"> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>"
